{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaceship Pro Simulator. Strapped in and ready. One ship, one mission\u2014survive the unknown. Enemies ahead, systems online. This is my journey through deep space, and I'm not going down easy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/8c6e4b8af287797c993d2b8df84b2936.poster.avif?t=1760723946\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/8c6e4b8af287797c993d2b8df84b2936.webm?t=1760723946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/8c6e4b8af287797c993d2b8df84b2936.mp4?t=1760723946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Spaceship Pro Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Pro Simulator puts you in the cockpit of a lone spacecraft, navigating the dangers of deep space. Face waves of enemies, manage your ship\u2019s systems, and make every shot count as you fight to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/239824d07faf4ce506002b84f8a04229.poster.avif?t=1760723946\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/239824d07faf4ce506002b84f8a04229.webm?t=1760723946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/239824d07faf4ce506002b84f8a04229.mp4?t=1760723946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this early chapter, you'll encounter one ship type and a single enemy class, giving you a taste of the chaos ahead. More challenges, upgrades, and ships are on the horizon\u2014prepare for the journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943370?t=1760723946","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943370?t=1760723946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/dabc450a8654222e4327e1ed6a22eef8a01c9a7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760723946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/dabc450a8654222e4327e1ed6a22eef8a01c9a7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760723946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Spaceship Pro Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/7b42bb6179a2f2edd1dc3ec6faf81111.avif?t=1760723946\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaceship Pro Simulator. Strapped in and ready. One ship, one mission\u2014survive the unknown. Enemies ahead, systems online. This is my journey through deep space, and I'm not going down easy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/8c6e4b8af287797c993d2b8df84b2936.poster.avif?t=1760723946\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943370/extras/8c6e4b8af287797c993d2b8df84b2936.webm?t=1760723946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka